    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "The normal band",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "The real plant's outlet temperature: median **18.0 °C**, 95th percentile **28.7 °C** (`simulator/calibration.json`). The rule in Node-RED fires above **30 °C**.\n\nThe line is grey while normal. Colour appears only above p95 (orange) and above the rule (red): the appearance of colour is itself the signal (ISA-101)."
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19
      }
    },
